{"seq":2,"slug":"two-step","title":"两步法：挖出可靠负例","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/positive-unlabeled-learning/methods/two-step","wordCount":1681,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"两步法-挖出可靠负例\">两步法：挖出可靠负例</h1><p>风险估计走的是「改数学」，两步法走的是「补数据」：既然负例只是没被标出来，那就先从未标注池里想办法把最像负例的样本挑出来，凑齐一批「可靠负例」，然后问题就退化成人人都会的普通监督二分类。这条路线比 nnPU 早得多，在文本分类、网页检索、生物信息里积累了大量成熟技巧，且有一个诱人的好处——它不需要显式知道类先验 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。本篇讲清两步的每一步怎么做、迭代如何收敛、以及它的软肋。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两步框架\">核心概念：两步框架</h2><p>两步法的骨架永远是同一个：第一步（Step 1）从未标注池 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 中识别出一个可靠负例子集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RN</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>（Reliable Negatives）；第二步（Step 2）用「已标注正例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> + 可靠负例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RN</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>」训练一个标准分类器，可选地用它给 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 剩余样本重新打分、扩充 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RN</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>、再训练，如此迭代。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[已标注正例 P + 未标注池 U] --&gt; B[Step 1 识别可靠负例]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[间谍法 Spy]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[1-DNF / 正类指纹]&#10;  B --&gt; B3[Rocchio / 朴素贝叶斯打分]&#10;  B --&gt; B4[PU-bagging 集成打分]&#10;  B1 --&gt; C[可靠负例集 RN]&#10;  B2 --&gt; C&#10;  B3 --&gt; C&#10;  B4 --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt; D[Step 2 用 P vs RN 训练监督分类器]&#10;  D --&gt; E{迭代扩充 RN?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是 打分 U 剩余| C&#10;  E --&gt;|否 收敛| F[最终 PU 分类器]\">graph TD\n  A[已标注正例 P + 未标注池 U] --&gt; B[Step 1 识别可靠负例]\n  B --&gt; B1[间谍法 Spy]\n  B --&gt; B2[1-DNF / 正类指纹]\n  B --&gt; B3[Rocchio / 朴素贝叶斯打分]\n  B --&gt; B4[PU-bagging 集成打分]\n  B1 --&gt; C[可靠负例集 RN]\n  B2 --&gt; C\n  B3 --&gt; C\n  B4 --&gt; C\n  C --&gt; D[Step 2 用 P vs RN 训练监督分类器]\n  D --&gt; E{迭代扩充 RN?}\n  E --&gt;|是 打分 U 剩余| C\n  E --&gt;|否 收敛| F[最终 PU 分类器]</pre><p>关键判断落在第一步：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RN</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 的纯度（里面混进多少真正例）直接决定第二步分类器的质量。第一步太激进会把隐藏正例误当负例、污染训练；太保守则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RN</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 太小、监督信号不足。这条张力贯穿所有具体技巧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"step-1-的四类挖掘技巧\">Step 1 的四类挖掘技巧</h2><p><strong>间谍法（Spy）</strong>。最经典也最稳的做法。从已标注正例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 里随机抽出一小部分（如 10%–15%）作为「间谍」，偷偷混进未标注池 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 一起训练一个初始分类器。因为间谍本身是货真价实的正例，它们在分类器上的得分分布，就近似代表了「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 里那些隐藏正例」的得分长什么样。于是取间谍得分的一个低分位（如最低的 5% 分位）作阈值：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 中得分低于此阈值的样本，才敢认定为可靠负例。间谍法的巧妙在于用「已知正例伪装成未标注」来校准阈值，避免了拍脑袋定界。</p>\n<p><strong>1-DNF / 正类指纹</strong>。面向文本等离散特征。统计哪些特征在正例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 里出现频率明显高于在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 里的频率，收集成一组「正类特征」；然后凡是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 里<strong>一个正类特征都不含</strong>的样本，判为可靠负例。它极其保守、纯度高但召回低，常作为其它方法的种子。</p>\n<p><strong>Rocchio 与原型打分</strong>。构造正类原型向量与「未标注原型」向量，把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 中离正类原型远、离未标注原型近的样本挑为负。适合向量空间模型下的文本。</p>\n<p><strong>PU-bagging（集成打分）</strong>。现代化的稳健做法：反复从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 里有放回地抽样一个子集当「临时负例」，与全部 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 训练一个分类器，对<strong>没被抽到的那些 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 样本</strong>打分（out-of-bag）；重复很多轮后，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 样本得到一个平均得分——始终被判为负的即可靠负例。它借了 bagging 的方差削减，不依赖单次划分的运气，是当下两步法里最推荐的第一步。</p>\n<p>下表按纯度、召回、适用数据、对先验的依赖对四类技巧做速查。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技巧</th>\n<th align=\"center\">RN 纯度</th>\n<th align=\"center\">RN 召回</th>\n<th>适用数据</th>\n<th align=\"center\">是否需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>间谍法 Spy</td>\n<td align=\"center\">中高</td>\n<td align=\"center\">中</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n<td align=\"center\">否</td>\n<td>阈值自校准，最稳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1-DNF 指纹</td>\n<td align=\"center\">高</td>\n<td align=\"center\">低</td>\n<td>离散 / 文本</td>\n<td align=\"center\">否</td>\n<td>保守，常作种子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rocchio 原型</td>\n<td align=\"center\">中</td>\n<td align=\"center\">中</td>\n<td>向量文本</td>\n<td align=\"center\">否</td>\n<td>依赖原型质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PU-bagging</td>\n<td align=\"center\">高</td>\n<td align=\"center\">中高</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n<td align=\"center\">否</td>\n<td>集成降方差，现代首选</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"step-2-与迭代收敛\">Step 2 与迭代收敛</h2><p>拿到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RN</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 后，第二步就是普通监督学习：用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 当正、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RN</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 当负，训练任意分类器（SVM、GBDT、神经网络皆可）。经典的 S-EM、PEBL、Roc-SVM 等算法在此基础上加了<strong>迭代扩充</strong>：用当前分类器给 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 中尚未归类的样本打分，把新判为「高置信负」的样本并入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RN</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，重训，直到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RN</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 不再增长或分类器稳定。</p>\n<p>迭代要小心两个陷阱。其一是<strong>漂移</strong>：每轮把新负例并进来，若某轮误纳了真正例，错误会在后续轮里被放大（确认偏差），这与半监督伪标签的自训练是同一类病，见 <a href=\"../../semi-supervised-learning/practice/confirmation-bias\">半监督的确认偏差</a>。缓解办法是设保守的并入阈值、限制迭代轮数、或每轮回看间谍得分做校验。其二是<strong>停机准则</strong>：没有真负例做验证，何时停？常用做法是监控分类器在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 上的召回（不应下降太多）与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RN</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 规模的增长曲线拐点，这与无负例评估问题相通，见 <a href=\"../practice/pu-evaluation\">PU 评估</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与风险估计的取舍\">与风险估计的取舍</h2><p>两步法与 <a href=\"risk-estimation\">风险估计 nnPU</a> 常被拿来比。二者不是对立，而是各有主场：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>不需要类先验</strong>是两步法的最大优势。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 难以可靠估计（见 <a href=\"class-prior\">类先验估计</a> 里讨论的不可辨识性），nnPU 会因先验偏而整体偏，两步法反而更稳。</li>\n<li>两步法能<strong>复用任何成熟的监督管线</strong>（现成的 GBDT 调参经验、特征工程、可解释性工具），对工程团队友好。</li>\n<li>但两步法把误差集中压在第一步的启发式上：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RN</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 一旦不纯，后面再精细也白搭；而 nnPU 是端到端优化真实风险，理论上更干净。</li>\n<li>数据高维、模型需端到端训练（如图像、文本嵌入）时，nnPU 通常更强；表格数据 + 成熟监督栈时，两步法性价比高。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个实用折中是把两者串起来：先用 PU-bagging 得到高质量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RN</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，再把「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 正、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RN</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 负、剩余 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 未标注」喂给带先验的风险估计，兼得可靠负例的稳与风险估计的无偏。选型全景见 <a href=\"../foundations/pu-taxonomy\">PU 方法谱系</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>两步法框架：Step 1 从未标注池挖可靠负例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RN</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，Step 2 用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> vs <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RN</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 转普通监督学习，可迭代扩充。</li>\n<li>第一步四类技巧——间谍法（自校准阈值，最稳）、1-DNF（保守高纯）、Rocchio（原型）、PU-bagging（集成降方差，现代首选）——纯度与召回此消彼长。</li>\n<li>迭代扩充要防确认偏差漂移与停机难题，本质与半监督自训练同源。</li>\n<li>相比 nnPU，两步法不需类先验、可复用成熟监督栈，但误差集中在第一步启发式；高维端到端场景 nnPU 更优，二者可串联互补。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>端到端改写风险的替代路线：<a href=\"risk-estimation\">风险估计 uPU/nnPU</a></li>\n<li>为何有时不得不放弃显式先验：<a href=\"class-prior\">类先验估计</a></li>\n<li>迭代扩充的停机与验证：<a href=\"../practice/pu-evaluation\">PU 评估</a></li>\n<li>方法家族全景：<a href=\"../foundations/pu-taxonomy\">PU 方法谱系</a></li>\n<li>跨库对照——同源的自训练与确认偏差：<a href=\"../../semi-supervised-learning/practice/confirmation-bias\">半监督的确认偏差</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"两步法：挖出可靠负例","id":"两步法-挖出可靠负例"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两步框架","id":"核心概念-两步框架"},{"level":2,"text":"Step 1 的四类挖掘技巧","id":"step-1-的四类挖掘技巧"},{"level":2,"text":"Step 2 与迭代收敛","id":"step-2-与迭代收敛"},{"level":2,"text":"与风险估计的取舍","id":"与风险估计的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"风险估计：uPU 与 nnPU","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/positive-unlabeled-learning/methods/risk-estimation"},"next":{"title":"类先验估计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/positive-unlabeled-learning/methods/class-prior"}}